cff-version: 1.2.0
message: Please cite this software preview when using RoboPaintBench.
type: software
title: 'RoboPaintBench: From pixels to physical strokes'
authors:
  - name: RoboPaintBench contributors
version: 0.1.0-preview
url: https://github.com/P90-RushB/robopaint-bench
repository-code: https://github.com/P90-RushB/robopaint-bench
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A visual, replayable benchmark of language models controlling a simulated
  robot arm to paint, built on AgentArk. The initial Golden Gate collection
  includes eleven models and three sequential attempts per model.
